@startuml lld-us16-class
title LLD-US16 Enforce the daily transfer limit: class diagram
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
class LimitService <<service>> {
  - dailyLimit = 1000000
  + check(cust, amt)
}
class TransferRepo <<repository>> {
  + sumToday(cust)
}
LimitService --> TransferRepo
@enduml